Z||000000||FieroSTETZ||10-29-2000||12:23 AM||||i know some berettas and cavaliers used 2.8's, so would any of the go fast goodies/swaps work on these? the rsm supercharger? i think a beretta GT w/ the 3.4tdc would be cool, a beretta with a 3800SC? hmmm. i have been looking for another car that holds more people, fiero for fun, beretta for fun with friends?<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1012904&a=7460599&p=25516673"> ||||reg||5
